// Studio — every product in the catalogue, in 3D: paint it, theme it, set the scene, dream it, share it.
//
// Data only: museum/catalog/products.json (generated by tools/build_catalog.mjs), museum/skins,
// museum/themes/films.json, museum/wyld_room.json, museum/events/*.json. Engine modules are shared
// with the museum: engine/skins.js (the one livery system), engine/card.js, engine/profile.js,
// engine/share.js, ui/settings.js. State lives in the URL (?p=&s=&scene=&event=) so every look is a link.
